mo><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><mn>9</mn></mroot></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mroot><mn>512</mn><mn>9</mn></mroot></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mroot><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mn>9</mn></mroot></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the solution is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"39\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
